== POST /users ==
a complete request
  -> {"user_name":"ali","email":"ali@example.com","role":"Admin","address":{"city":"Tehran","country":"IR"},"tags":["founder","ops"]}
  <- {"id":"9007199254740991","user_name":"ali","email":"ali@example.com","role":"Admin","address":{"city":"Tehran","country":"IR"},"tags":["founder","ops"]}
only the required fields
  -> {"user_name":"sara","email":"sara@example.com"}
  <- {"id":"9007199254740992","user_name":"sara","email":"sara@example.com","role":"Member","address":{"city":"","country":""}}

== requests the decoder rejects ==
a missing field
  -> {"user_name":"kian"}
  <- {"error":"bad_request","detail":"missing key 'email'"}
a field this version does not have
  -> {"user_name":"kian","email":"k@example.com","nickname":"kk"}
  <- {"error":"bad_request","detail":"unknown key","at":55}
the wrong type
  -> {"user_name":42,"email":"k@example.com"}
  <- {"error":"bad_request","detail":"value does not match the expected type","at":13}
the same key twice
  -> {"user_name":"a","user_name":"b","email":"k@example.com"}
  <- {"error":"bad_request","detail":"duplicate key 'user_name'","at":29}
an enum member that does not exist
  -> {"user_name":"k","email":"k@example.com","role":"Owner"}
  <- {"error":"bad_request","detail":"no enum member with that name","at":48}
not an object at all
  -> [1,2,3]
  <- {"error":"bad_request","detail":"expected '{'"}
truncated
  -> {"user_name":"k",
  <- {"error":"bad_request","detail":"expected an object key","at":17}

== a rule the decoder cannot know ==
empty email
  -> {"user_name":"k","email":""}
  <- {"error":"unprocessable","detail":"email must not be empty"}

== an older client, decoded leniently ==
  <- {"user_name":"omid","email":"o@example.com","role":"Member","address":{"city":"","country":""}}

== GET /users ==
  <- {"total":2,"items":[{"id":"9007199254740991","user_name":"ali","email":"ali@example.com","role":"Admin","address":{"city":"Tehran","country":"IR"},"tags":["founder","ops"]},{"id":"9007199254740992","user_name":"sara","email":"sara@example.com","role":"Member","address":{"city":"","country":""}}]}

== round trip ==
decodes: true
re-encodes identically: true
first user's city: Tehran
